 rize among other awards. An anthology of his art writing\, Blind Handshake
 \, was published by Periscope Publishing. He teaches in the MFA program at
  Columbia University and is represented by the Fredericks & Freiser Galler
 y\, NY who published a monograph on his work in 2020 by Davy Lauterbach.\n
 \nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Vermont Studio Center\, 80 Pearl Street
